(18406, 10592, 'B, X, A, D, U, E, F, R, I, H, O, M, J, ......', 2, 'TIU', 'Materi Pembelajaran: TIU - Soal #10592', '', 'teks', NULL, 'uploads/bahan_pelajaran/text/materi_10592_1778528477.html', 0, 'C', 'Pola: B (2), X (24), A (1), D (4), U (21), E (5), F (6), R (18), I (9), H (8), O (15), M (13), J (10). Pola: 2, 24, 1, 4, 21, 5, 6, 18, 9, 8, 15, 13, 10. Selanjutnya: L (12), Q (17).'),
